{%- comment -%}
  ELOURA - Privacy Policy Template
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="eloura-page-wrapper">
  <div class="container eloura-legal-container">
    <div class="eloura-page-header">
      <span class="eloura-page-eyebrow">DATA PROTECTION</span>
      <h1 class="eloura-page-title">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
      <p class="eloura-page-subtitle">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="eloura-article-content">
      <h2>1. INTRODUCTION</h2>
      <p>ELOURA CLOTHING is committed to safeguarding your personal data and privacy. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, use, and protect your information when you browse our site, join our newsletter, or make a purchase.</p>

      <h2>2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT</h2>
      <p>When you place an order or interact with ELOURA, we collect personal information including your full name, shipping/billing address, phone number, email address, and order history to fulfill your purchases and provide support.</p>

      <h2>3. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To process, ship, and track your orders.</li>
        <li>To communicate order confirmations, tracking numbers, and delivery updates via SMS, email, or WhatsApp.</li>
        <li>To protect against fraudulent activities and unauthorized transactions.</li>
        <li>To provide customer support regarding sizing, exchanges, and product inquiries.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. SHARING OF INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We share data solely with trusted logistics and courier partners (e.g. TCS, Trax, Leopard) strictly to deliver your shipments.</p>

      <h2>5. DATA SECURITY</h2>
      <p>We employ SSL (Secure Socket Layer) encryption technology to safeguard your sensitive information during transmission across our website.</p>

      <h2>6. YOUR RIGHTS &amp; INQUIRIES</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or wish to update or delete your information, please contact us at <strong>Eloura.pk1@gmail.com</strong> or WhatsApp <strong>+92 325 5136747</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

